<title>UK: Panamanian flag wheat carrier sails for Gibraltar.</title>
<headline>Panamanian flag wheat carrier sails for Gibraltar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panama-flag bulker Mariner C., laden with 53,000 tonnes of wheat, has sailed St. Michael's in the Azores for Gibraltar, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 65,085-dwt vessel had been towed to St. Michael's with generator damage.</p>
</text>
